---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume — Praweg Koirala" description="Professional resume of Praweg Koirala — Software Engineer & Entrepreneur.">
  <div class="mb-8 print:hidden">
    <button class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-sm border border-transparent bg-accent px-8 py-2 text-base font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-accent-hover" onclick="window.print()">Print / Save as PDF</button>
  </div>

  <header class="mb-8 border-b-2 border-accent pb-4">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.02em] print:text-[24pt]">Praweg Koirala</h1>
    <p class="mt-1 text-2xl text-muted">Software Engineer &amp; Entrepreneur</p>
    <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm text-muted">
      <span>Kathmandu, Nepal</span>
      <span><a href="https://prawegko.dev" class="text-accent transition-colors hover:text-accent-hover hover:underline">prawegko.dev</a></span>
      <span><a href="https://github.com/koirpraw" class="text-accent transition-colors hover:text-accent-hover hover:underline">github.com/koirpraw</a></span>
      <span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/prawegko" class="text-accent transition-colors hover:text-accent-hover hover:underline">linkedin.com/in/prawegko</a></span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="my-16">
    <h2 class="mb-4 border-b border-line pb-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.01em]">Summary</h2>
    <p>Software engineer and entrepreneur with a decade of experience building digital products. Cloud-certified (AWS), AI-focused, and hands-on with the full stack — from agentic pipelines to mobile apps. I turn product ideas into working systems.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="my-16">
    <h2 class="mb-4 border-b border-line pb-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.01em]">Experience</h2>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Founder</h3>
      <span class="font-semibold text-accent">PkoLabs LLC</span>
      <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted">2024 — Present</span>
      <ul class="my-2 list-disc pl-8">
        <li class="mb-1 text-muted">Building AI-powered products and cloud-native solutions</li>
        <li class="mb-1 text-muted">Developing agentic pipelines with ADK and Gemini</li>
        <li class="mb-1 text-muted">Creating ComfyUI custom nodes for cloud storage integration</li>
        <li class="mb-1 text-muted">Designing and deploying cloud infrastructure with Terraform and AWS</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Co-founder</h3>
      <span class="font-semibold text-accent">KDuo Production</span>
      <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted">2012 — Present</span>
      <ul class="my-2 list-disc pl-8">
        <li class="mb-1 text-muted">Co-founded a production house delivering digital products to local and international clients</li>
        <li class="mb-1 text-muted">Leading technology strategy, architecture, and development</li>
        <li class="mb-1 text-muted">Built web platforms, mobile apps, and cloud infrastructure</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Senior Engineer</h3>
      <span class="font-semibold text-accent">ARUP Labs</span>
      <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted">2012 — 2020</span>
      <ul class="my-2 list-disc pl-8">
        <li class="mb-1 text-muted">Led biomedical engineering software projects</li>
        <li class="mb-1 text-muted">Built healthcare technology solutions and laboratory information systems</li>
        <li class="mb-1 text-muted">Developed software for medical equipment integration</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="my-16">
    <h2 class="mb-4 border-b border-line pb-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.01em]">Certifications</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-8">
      <li class="mb-1">AWS Solutions Architect — Associate (July 2026)</li>
      <li class="mb-1">AWS Cloud Practitioner (July 2026)</li>
      <li class="mb-1">HuggingFace AI Agents (2025)</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="my-16">
    <h2 class="mb-4 border-b border-line pb-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.01em]">Technical Skills</h2>
    <div class="grid gap-4">
      <div class="border-b border-line py-2 last:border-b-0"><strong>Languages:</strong> Python, TypeScript, JavaScript, Dart, SQL</div>
      <div class="border-b border-line py-2 last:border-b-0"><strong>Frameworks:</strong> NextJS, Astro, React, Flutter, Express, Node.js</div>
      <div class="border-b border-line py-2 last:border-b-0"><strong>Cloud:</strong> AWS (S3, CloudFront, Route53, IAM, Terraform), GCP, Docker</div>
      <div class="border-b border-line py-2 last:border-b-0"><strong>AI/ML:</strong> Agentic pipelines, ADK, Gemini API, ComfyUI, HuggingFace</div>
      <div class="border-b border-line py-2 last:border-b-0"><strong>Tools:</strong> Git, GitHub Actions, Vercel, MongoDB, PostgreSQL</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
